@zidel\_ I pushed my experimental code base on your idea [here](https://gitlab.com/jvalverde/wireshark/-/commit/e0d0fe48bbbf4c722ee4c5457ff3f2b153de9dac), if you'd like to check it out.

It's the approach I talked about in https://www.wireshark.org/lists/wireshark-dev/202106/msg00009.html, cleaned up a bit. Only the target 'test_dissectors' is building.

I will look into fixing the main build, if it's not too difficult or time-consuming.

